{"id":"617465","name":"香菇鸡肉炒糯米饭","author":"斌joanliu","authorId":"11138610","desc":"","cover":"images/617465/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"糯米","amount":"2杯"},{"name":"清水","amount":"1杯"}],"sub":[{"name":"香菇","amount":"八个"},{"name":"鸡胸肉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"生姜","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"糯米先泡两个小时，再两杯米一杯水将它煮好。","img":"images/617465/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"趁热打散，凉凉。","img":"images/617465/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"香菇去蒂，焯水。","img":"images/617465/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"鸡胸肉切小，放调料腌制二十分钟。","img":"images/617465/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"锅预热，放油，放姜片。","img":"images/617465/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"放入切片的香菇炒二分钟。","img":"images/617465/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"香菇推一边，放入鸡胸肉炒三分钟。","img":"images/617465/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"放入糯米饭，翻炒五分钟。","img":"images/617465/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"加点盐和生抽，翻炒均匀。","img":"images/617465/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"放点外婆菜，炒匀。","img":"images/617465/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"出锅。","img":"images/617465/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"享用。粘粘的，暖暖的。","img":"images/617465/step_12.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：不粘锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}